    {
      "id": "91d50e8040fd",
      "source": "Comment",
      "target": "注释",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "e223baf6dcf4",
      "source": "Comments can be used to organize your node graph and assign helpful descriptions to collections of nodes.",
      "target": "注释可用于整理节点图，并为一组节点添加有用的说明。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "09cf2be701dc",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "7645103156b6",
      "source": "To create a comment press ",
      "target": "若要创建注释，请按 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2dcc9ba1c2dc",
      "source": " or ",
      "target": " 或 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f4145e4c816",
      "source": "Ctrl + G",
      "target": "Ctrl + G",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e45614e67854",
      "source": "You can also ",
      "target": "你也可以",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "7eb25a9dcc15",
      "source": " click on one or more nodes and select ",
      "target": " 右键单击一个或多个节点，然后选择 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0256547fce7",
      "source": "Create Comment",
      "target": "Create Comment",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab5ba01a4102",
      "source": " in the context menu.",
      "target": "（位于上下文菜单）。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "35885c35055b",
      "source": "When one or more nodes are selected, the comment will fit around the selected nodes.",
      "target": "选中一个或多个节点时，注释会贴合所选节点的范围。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8f0c3202e31",
      "source": "When there are no nodes selected, the comment can be drawn in the node graph to specify its size and location.",
      "target": "没有选中节点时，可以在节点图中绘制注释，以指定它的大小和位置。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "972aa9f678f8",
      "source": "After creating a comment a text input field will appear. Here, the comment text can be set. When you’re done typing, you can press ",
      "target": "创建注释后会出现文本输入字段，你可以在这里设置注释文本。输入完成后，可以按 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "19c122abbeab",
      "source": "Enter",
      "target": "Enter",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "335772d267c1",
      "source": " or the blue checkmark button next to the text field to set the comment text.",
      "target": "，或点击文本字段旁边的蓝色对勾按钮来设置注释文本。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc794596d166",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6594209452f",
      "source": "Comments can be moved around in the Node Graph putting your cursor on the comment header and using ",
      "target": "若要在节点图中移动注释，请将光标放到注释标题上，然后使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "90bca44b057d",
      "source": " and dragging.",
      "target": " 并拖动。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "44f9b0d2c86e",
      "source": "Comments can be resized by putting your cursor on one of the corners of the comment and using ",
      "target": "若要调整注释大小，请将光标放到注释的某个角上，然后使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "76d97f575ba3",
      "source": " and dragging.",
      "target": " 并拖动。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "edbdebe00576",
      "source": "When using ",
      "target": "使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe39c93629e2",
      "source": " on the comment header, a context menu with the following options will pop up.",
      "target": " 操作注释标题时，会弹出包含以下选项的上下文菜单。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfa9d169e5da",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "588fb50e2deb",
      "source": "Set Comment Text:",
      "target": "Set Comment Text:",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "11b00ef056a1",
      "source": " This can also be done by double ",
      "target": " 也可以通过双击 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "d64b8077639b",
      "source": " clicking on the comment header.",
      "target": " 注释标题来完成。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "16484dbae24d",
      "source": "Select Content:",
      "target": "Select Content:",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ae1ecfde369",
      "source": " This will select all the nodes within the comment box. Note: A node is only considered the content of the comment when it’s fully within the comment box.",
      "target": " 这会选择注释框内的所有节点。注意：只有完全位于注释框内的节点，才会被视为该注释的内容。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "222971faf60b",
      "source": "Set Color:",
      "target": "Set Color:",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b6ba5ea1268",
      "source": " When hovering your cursor over this option, a color pallet will appear to the right of it. Here you can ",
      "target": " 将光标悬停在此选项上时，右侧会出现一个色板。你可以 ",
      "note": "stage 3A audit fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "48d72ad2ae58",
      "source": " click on the color you want the comment to have.",
      "target": " 点击希望该注释使用的颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ceabba91a66c",
      "source": "Tidy Up:",
      "target": "Tidy Up:",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6815830e00f1",
      "source": " This will refit the comment perfectly around its content. When nodes are selected, it will also try to align them nicely.",
      "target": " 这会让注释重新贴合其内容。选中节点时，它也会尝试将这些节点整齐对齐。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "16a38e2c6968",
      "source": "Delete:",
      "target": "Delete:",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d4e3d3c2c87",
      "source": " Delete the comment. This won’t delete all its content if those nodes aren’t selected. Note: This is the normal delete command for the Node Graph so it will also delete all selected nodes.",
      "target": " 删除注释。如果这些节点没有被选中，这不会删除注释中的所有内容。注意：这是节点图的常规删除命令，因此也会删除所有已选节点。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "8698a479585a",
      "source": "Next",
      "target": "下一页",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "92a368f063f0",
      "source": "Note",
      "target": "备注",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
